> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n  </font></td><td width=\"64\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" style=\"padding:0in 5.4pt;border:rgb(0,0,0);width:48pt;height:0.2in;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n  </font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n  </font></td><td width=\"70\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" style=\"padding:0in 5.4pt;border:rgb(0,0,0);width:48pt;height:0.2in;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n  </font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n  </font></td></tr></tbody></table><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Most discussion that I have seen notes that p-vals &lt;.05\r\ncould be interpreted as significant, and the model has either poor fit or\r\nunder/over dispersion depending on the value of c-hat. But what about p-values\r\nof 1 or close to it?<span>  </span>I have a few\r\nspecies where this is the case, and most are paired with c-hat values\r\n&lt;.8.<span>  </span>Is this indicative of\r\nsignificant underdispersion and/or lack of fit?<span> \r\n</span>Furthermore, does anyone have any rough cut off point for when\r\nunderdispersion is “too great” and the model should be rejected (if at all)?</font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\">Thanks</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\">Cal</p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"><br></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></div><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"><br></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></div>"
